OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers more loo fees
OL,4,Afollowing #1 charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council that introduced a #1 fee for
OL,7,Fnew city centre public loos is
OL,8,Fconsidering charging for other toilets.
OL,10,FIn the summer, Cambridge City Council
OL,11,Fdefended charging for the facilities on
OL,12,FSilver Street bridge, which replaced
OL,13,Fthe old conveniences at a cost of
OL,14,Fnearly #1m.
OL,16,FThe authority is now looking into
OL,17,Fcontactless payments as part of the
OL,18,Freopening of Quayside toilets off
OL,19,FBridge Street, near Jesus Green.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
