OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers more loo fees
OL,4,Afollowing #1 charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's cabinet on Wednesday
OL,7,Fheard plans for the future operating
OL,8,Fmodel for the toilets, including
OL,9,Fcharging mechanisms, were in the early
OL,10,Fstages.
